{"seq":1,"slug":"fragmentation-ack-flow-control-coexistence","title":"分片、确认与流控：大包传输的可靠性与 2.4GHz 共存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-ble-bluetooth-nfc-connectivity-engineering/reliable-data-transfer-background-connection/fragmentation-ack-flow-control-coexistence","wordCount":2727,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"分片-确认与流控-大包传输的可靠性与-2-4ghz-共存\">分片、确认与流控：大包传输的可靠性与 2.4GHz 共存</h1><p>跨境电商的移动端一旦要把超过几十字节的数据搬过 BLE——固件 OTA 包、离线订单批量同步、冷链温度标签的历史曲线、电子价签整屏刷新——就会立刻撞上一堵墙：蓝牙的 ATT 层默认一次只肯收 <strong>20 字节有效载荷</strong>。更麻烦的是，BLE 的连接层&quot;可靠&quot;到只保证单个数据包不丢，它不保证整段数据完整到达，也不保证接收端的缓冲区不被压垮。把大包拆开、逐段确认、按对方处理能力放行，这套逻辑全部得在应用层自己实现。本文把分片、确认与流控拆成可计算的模块，并解释为什么 2.4GHz 的 Wi-Fi 干扰会让设计余量变得很窄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么-ble-的-可靠-不等于-你的数据可靠\">核心概念：为什么 BLE 的&quot;可靠&quot;不等于&quot;你的数据可靠&quot;</h2><p>BLE 栈分四层：物理层/链路层（PHY/LL）、L2CAP、ATT、GATT。要做流控，必须分清每层各自的可靠性边界——<strong>上层的缺口正是下层没有承诺的部分</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[应用: 大包 payload&lt;br/&gt;如 128 KB OTA 镜像] --&gt; B{应用层分片}&#10;    B --&gt;|chunk 0..n, 每片带序号| C[GATT Write / Notify]&#10;    C --&gt; D[ATT 层&lt;br/&gt;Handle + Value]&#10;    D --&gt; E[L2CAP&lt;br/&gt;CoC 信用流控 或&lt;br/&gt;固定信道 23 字节]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Link Layer&lt;br/&gt;DLE 251 字节载荷&lt;br/&gt;逐包 ACK/NACK + 自动重传]&#10;    F --&gt; G{2.4 GHz 空口}&#10;    G --&gt;|Wi-Fi / 微波炉干扰| H[包被丢弃]&#10;    H --&gt; F&#10;    G --&gt; I[对端 LL 收到 → L2CAP 重装 → ATT → GATT]&#10;    I --&gt; K[应用层重组 + 累积 ACK + 窗口放行]\">graph TD\n    A[应用: 大包 payload&lt;br/&gt;如 128 KB OTA 镜像] --&gt; B{应用层分片}\n    B --&gt;|chunk 0..n, 每片带序号| C[GATT Write / Notify]\n    C --&gt; D[ATT 层&lt;br/&gt;Handle + Value]\n    D --&gt; E[L2CAP&lt;br/&gt;CoC 信用流控 或&lt;br/&gt;固定信道 23 字节]\n    E --&gt; F[Link Layer&lt;br/&gt;DLE 251 字节载荷&lt;br/&gt;逐包 ACK/NACK + 自动重传]\n    F --&gt; G{2.4 GHz 空口}\n    G --&gt;|Wi-Fi / 微波炉干扰| H[包被丢弃]\n    H --&gt; F\n    G --&gt; I[对端 LL 收到 → L2CAP 重装 → ATT → GATT]\n    I --&gt; K[应用层重组 + 累积 ACK + 窗口放行]</pre><p>这张图给出三个必须由应用层补上的洞。其一，<strong>ATT 不保证交付语义完整</strong>：无响应写在 ATT 层不产生任何响应，发起方无从知道对端是否收到；有响应写虽有响应，但一次一个属性、同步阻塞，且只证明写到了 ATT 层，不证明应用层落了盘。其二，<strong>链路层的 ACK 是逐包的、不是逐消息的</strong>：LL 自动重传只保证单个 LL 数据包要么被确认、要么超时，多包消息的原子性完全留给上层，分片链中途断连就留下半截数据。其三，<strong>没有背压的流控就是压垮接收端</strong>：发起方按自己空口速率猛推，接收端回调与缓冲区来不及处理——Android 上尤其明显，因为 GATT 操作是串行的。</p>\n<p>结论：<strong>BLE 之上的大包传输，本质上是一个跑在不可靠、无消息边界、无背压链路上的自定义可靠传输协议</strong>，需要的不是&quot;多写几次&quot;，而是一套带序号、确认、窗口和超时的状态机。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>它承诺什么</th>\n<th>它<strong>不</strong>承诺什么</th>\n<th>大包传输的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PHY / Link Layer</td>\n<td>单包 CRC 校验 + ACK/NACK + 自动重传</td>\n<td>多包消息的原子性</td>\n<td>断连时留半截数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2CAP 固定信道</td>\n<td>把 23 字节 SDU 直接映射</td>\n<td>背压（除 CoC 模式外）</td>\n<td>无流控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2CAP CoC（信用模式）</td>\n<td>基于信用量的端到端流控</td>\n<td>应用层语义的确认</td>\n<td>需上层再叠确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ATT / GATT</td>\n<td>Write Request 有响应、属性寻址</td>\n<td>交付到应用层、批量原子性</td>\n<td>必须自建 ACK</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mtu-协商与分片边界-20-字节的起点与-517-的上限\">MTU 协商与分片边界：20 字节的起点与 517 的上限</h2><p>分片的第一决策是&quot;一片切多大&quot;。ATT 层的 <strong>ATT_MTU</strong> 决定一次读写能携带的最大有效载荷：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>默认 ATT_MTU = 23 字节</strong>：1 字节操作码 + 2 字节属性句柄，留给载荷只有 <strong>20 字节</strong>（Bluetooth Core Specification Vol 3 Part F，<a href=\"https://www.bluetooth.com/specifications/specs/\">bluetooth.com/specifications</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>最大 ATT_MTU = 517 字节</strong>，对应载荷上限 512 字节，这是规范硬上限，任何&quot;MTU 可到 1024&quot;的说法都是错的。</li>\n<li>实际值由双方协商取小：<code>ATT_MTU = min(clientMax, serverMax)</code>。iOS 用 <code>maximumWriteValueLength(for:)</code> 查上限；Android 用 <code>requestMtu()</code> 发 <code>ATT_EXCHANGE_MTU_REQ</code>，回调 <code>onMtuChanged()</code> 得结果（<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/bluetooth/BluetoothGatt\">developer.android.com</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>与 MTU 正交的另一个旋钮是链路层的 <strong>Data Length Extension（DLE，BLE 4.2 引入）</strong>：把单个 LL 数据包载荷从默认 27 字节提到最大 <strong>251 字节</strong>。251 是 <strong>LL 层</strong>字节数，ATT_MTU 是 <strong>ATT 层</strong>字节数，两者必须协同：若 ATT_MTU 是 517 而 LL 载荷停在 27，一个 512 字节的 ATT 包会被拆成约 20 个 LL 包，每包独立 ACK，吞吐被往返拖垮。常见调优组合是 <strong>DLE 251 + ATT_MTU 247</strong>（247 − 3 = 244 字节载荷，正好塞进 251 的 LL 包不跨包）。</p>\n<p>分片大小一旦定下，片数就是确定值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>chunks</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>chunk</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>chunk</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mtext>ATT_MTU</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{chunks}} = \\left\\lceil \\frac{L_{\\text{total}}}{P_{\\text{chunk}}} \\right\\rceil, \\quad P_{\\text{chunk}} \\le \\text{ATT\\_MTU} - 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunks</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ATT_MTU</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>chunk</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{chunk}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 还要扣掉自定义协议头。若协议头用 4 字节（序号 + 总片数/CRC），247 的 MTU 下每片净荷约 240 字节。很多人按 244 估吞吐，实测差 3%–5%。更细的 MTU/句柄寻址规则见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../ble-stack-gatt-data-model/gatt-service-characteristic-descriptor-model\">GATT 服务、特征与描述符模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确认与重传-从-stop-and-wait-到滑动窗口\">确认与重传：从 Stop-and-Wait 到滑动窗口</h2><p>分片之后的核心问题是<strong>收端如何告诉发端&quot;下一片可以来了&quot;</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>Write With Response（有响应写）</strong> 每次写都收到 ATT 响应，天然带确认，但<strong>一次只能有一个未完成的 GATT 操作</strong>。Android 的 <code>BluetoothGatt</code> 内部是串行队列，在收到 <code>onCharacteristicWrite()</code> 回调之前，任何新的 <code>writeCharacteristic()</code> 都返回 <code>false</code>（<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/bluetooth/BluetoothGatt\">developer.android.com</a>）。Stop-and-Wait 的吞吐因此被每片往返时延锁死：片时延 ≈ 一个连接间隔（典型 15–50 ms）。按 30 ms 间隔、240 字节片算，稳态吞吐约：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>stop-and-wait</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>chunk</mtext></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>conn interval</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>240</mn><mtext> B</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>0.03</mn><mtext> s</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext> KB/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{stop-and-wait}} \\approx \\frac{P_{\\text{chunk}}}{T_{\\text{conn interval}}} = \\frac{240\\ \\text{B}}{0.03\\ \\text{s}} \\approx 8\\ \\text{KB/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop-and-wait</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">conn interval</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.03</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">240</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB/s</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个数字对 128 KB 的 OTA 就是 16 秒以上，还不算重传。所以真实实现几乎都会放弃&quot;每片等一次 ATT 响应&quot;，改用<strong>应用层滑动窗口</strong>：发端连续推 N 片（窗口 W），收端每收到 k 片回一条 Notify 作为累积 ACK，发端据此滑动窗口。这条 Notify 走<strong>反向</strong> GATT 通知，不占用前向写队列，因此前向可以连发；窗口 W 的上限由对方缓冲区决定——正是流控要解决的问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>前向确认来源</th>\n<th>并发度</th>\n<th>典型吞吐</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Write With Response（Stop-and-Wait）</td>\n<td>ATT 响应</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>~8–15 KB/s</td>\n<td>小配置写、可靠性优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write Without Response + 应用 ACK</td>\n<td>反向 Notify</td>\n<td>W（窗口）</td>\n<td>~100–700 KB/s</td>\n<td>OTA、批量同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2CAP CoC 信用模式</td>\n<td>信用量 + LL ACK</td>\n<td>信用额度</td>\n<td>可接近 LE 2M 上限</td>\n<td>文件级大传输</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>重传策略两条规则：<strong>用累积 ACK 而非逐片 ACK</strong>（收端只回&quot;已连续收到序号 ≤ X&quot;，发端重传 X+1 起）；<strong>超时用倍数而非固定值</strong>（<code>4 × 连接间隔</code> 起步并按连续超时次数退避），否则干扰突发时会误判丢包、无谓重传加剧拥塞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流控-信用机制与背压从哪来\">流控：信用机制与背压从哪来</h2><p>窗口 W 开多大不是拍脑袋——<strong>开太大就是拒绝服务自己</strong>。BLE 链路没有 TCP 那样的拥塞窗口自动收敛，收端缓冲区溢出表现为&quot;包丢了却没有 ACK&quot;，发端只能靠超时盲重传，越重传越堵，所以必须有一层显式背压。</p>\n<p><strong>方案一：L2CAP CoC 的信用流控。</strong> LE Credit Based Flow Control Mode（Bluetooth Core Specification Vol 3 Part A）用信用量（credits）做端到端流控：建立时双方各给对端一笔初始信用，发送方每发一个 SDU 扣一个，接收方每向应用层递交一个 SDU 归还一个（LE Flow Control Credit 帧），信用为 0 时必须停。这是<strong>协议级、有背压</strong>的方案，适合文件级传输；代价是要求两端都实现 CoC（Android 的 <code>BluetoothDevice.createL2capChannel()</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>方案二：应用层信用/窗口通告。</strong> 不改 CoC 时，用反向 Notify 携带&quot;我还能再收 N 片&quot;的通告，收端每处理完一片就累加额度。实现简单、跨平台，代价是通告占反向带宽且有一拍延迟。</p>\n<p><strong>方案三：尊重平台硬约束。</strong> Android 的 GATT 是<strong>串行</strong>的——一次只有一个未完成的请求，连发 Write Without Response 仍可能被内部队列限流，应用层必须自维护&quot;在途未确认片数&quot;。iOS 允许 <code>withoutResponse</code> 连发，但 <code>canSendWriteWithoutResponse</code> 为 <code>false</code> 时必须暂停并等 <code>peripheralIsReady(toSendWriteWithoutResponse:)</code> 回调——这就是 iOS 给的<strong>链路级背压信号</strong>（<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/corebluetooth/cbperipheral\">developer.apple.com</a>）。忽略它会导致写被静默丢弃。</p>\n<p>窗口安全上限可用下式估算，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 吸收重组乱序与回调积压的峰值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>rx buffer</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>chunk</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>η</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W \\le \\left\\lfloor \\frac{B_{\\text{rx buffer}} \\cdot \\eta}{P_{\\text{chunk}}} \\right\\rfloor, \\quad \\eta \\approx 0.5\\text{–}0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chunk</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rx buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上从 4–8 片起步，按实测丢包率往上探。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-4ghz-共存-设计余量最薄的地方\">2.4GHz 共存：设计余量最薄的地方</h2><p>BLE 和 Wi-Fi 挤在同一段 2.4 GHz ISM 频段，很多移动设备的 Wi-Fi 与蓝牙甚至<strong>共用同一套射频前端和天线</strong>，靠包流量仲裁（PTA, Packet Traffic Arbitration）在毫秒级争抢。直接含义是：<strong>BLE 的有效吞吐和时延在真实环境里比实验室低一大截</strong>，大包传输必须按&quot;最差现场&quot;留余量。</p>\n<p>BLE 用<strong>自适应跳频（AFH）<strong>对抗干扰：链路层维护 channel map 标记 37 个数据信道的好坏，只从好信道里跳，规范要求好信道</strong>至少保留 2 个</strong>；BLE 5.0 起 <strong>CSA#2</strong> 改进跳频序列，对 Wi-Fi 周期性占用更鲁棒。细节见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../ble-stack-gatt-data-model/ble-phy-link-layer-channel-hopping\">BLE 物理层与链路层：信道划分、跳频与空口时隙建模</a>。</p>\n<p>跨境部署最典型的事故，是把一套在中国仓库调好的 channel map 直接搬到 Wi-Fi 规划不同的海外仓库。Wi-Fi 主用信道 1/6/11 落在 2412/2437/2462 MHz，若目标市场 AP 密集、占用与国内不同，被标为&quot;好&quot;的信道恰好落进干扰峰值，丢包率骤升、重传变多、有效吞吐塌方。<strong>channel map 必须随现场射频环境重算，不能跨地域沿用。</strong></p>\n<p>共存对协议的三个可操作结论：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>连接间隔不是越长越稳。</strong> 间隔越长，事件前静默越久，但 Wi-Fi 抢到空口的窗口也越多；大包传输常用较短间隔（15–30 ms）保证重传及时。扫描/广播占空比的影响见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../scan-connect-pair-bond-engineering/advertising-scan-parameters-duty-cycle\">广播与扫描参数工程</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>重传上限要与 supervision timeout 一起调。</strong> timeout 太小（如 1–2 s）会在 Wi-Fi 密集突发时误判断连并触发整条链路重连——对大包传输是灾难，已传的片全部作废。</li>\n<li><strong>吞吐预算按 30%–70% 折减。</strong> LE 2M PHY 标称 2 Mbps，扣掉前导、接入地址、头部、CRC、帧间间隔与 ACK 往返后，应用层实测通常在标称的 30%–70%（<a href=\"https://www.bluetooth.com/specifications/specs/\">bluetooth.com</a>）；按这个折减规划 OTA 时长比按理论峰值更接近现实。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三件事必须应用层自己做</strong>：分片、确认、流控。BLE 只保证单包不丢，不保证你的消息完整。</li>\n<li><strong>分片边界由 ATT_MTU 决定</strong>：默认 23（载荷 20 字节），最大 517；配合 DLE 251 的最优组合是 MTU 247，协议头必须从净荷里扣。</li>\n<li><strong>Stop-and-Wait 太慢</strong>：Android 的 GATT 串行，逐片等 ATT 响应只有约 8–15 KB/s；大包改用无响应写 + 累积 ACK + 滑动窗口。</li>\n<li><strong>流控要有背压</strong>：L2CAP CoC 信用模式是协议级方案；应用层窗口通告是常见折衷；iOS 的 <code>peripheralIsReady</code> 和 Android 串行队列必须尊重。</li>\n<li><strong>2.4GHz 共存吃掉余量</strong>：Wi-Fi 争抢让实测吞吐只有标称的 30%–70%；channel map 不可跨地域沿用，supervision timeout 与重传上限要协同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分片、确认与流控：大包传输的可靠性与 2.4GHz 共存","id":"分片-确认与流控-大包传输的可靠性与-2-4ghz-共存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么 BLE 的\"可靠\"不等于\"你的数据可靠\"","id":"核心概念-为什么-ble-的-可靠-不等于-你的数据可靠"},{"level":2,"text":"MTU 协商与分片边界：20 字节的起点与 517 的上限","id":"mtu-协商与分片边界-20-字节的起点与-517-的上限"},{"level":2,"text":"确认与重传：从 Stop-and-Wait 到滑动窗口","id":"确认与重传-从-stop-and-wait-到滑动窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"流控：信用机制与背压从哪来","id":"流控-信用机制与背压从哪来"},{"level":2,"text":"2.4GHz 共存：设计余量最薄的地方","id":"2-4ghz-共存-设计余量最薄的地方"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"配对与绑定：GAP 安全模式、LE Secure Connections 与密钥存储治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-ble-bluetooth-nfc-connectivity-engineering/scan-connect-pair-bond-engineering/pairing-bonding-security-gap-le-secure"},"next":{"title":"后台连接的平台约束：iOS 状态保留与 Android 省电/前台服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-ble-bluetooth-nfc-connectivity-engineering/reliable-data-transfer-background-connection/background-connection-ios-android-constraints"}}